  "text": "Claude, Codex Gemini, on their own. Every one of them is an empty lot. Good land. Nothing built on it. Boss is the house that's already standing. Rooms for marketing, for sales, for your clients. And the house rules up on the wall. This dashboard is the front door. Chief sits right here. Chief is just the name I chose for my main assistant. You can call yours anything you like. Behind him is the whole team. 16 managers and 136 specialists. Each one trained for a single job. You never meet them one at a time. you talk to chief and all of it stays on your computer.",
